{"id":"otnyud_","lemma":"отнюдь","pos":"adv","rank":4392,"glosses":["not at all, by no means"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8E%D0%B4%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8E%D0%B4%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он был отнюдь не счастлив.","en":"He was not happy at all.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Мой французский отнюдь не хорош.","en":"My French isn't good at all.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"French"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"enough, stop"}]},{"text":"Она отнюдь не глупа.","en":"She is by no means stupid.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Это отнюдь не лёгкая работа.","en":"It is by no means an easy job.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"light, lightweight","l":"лёгкий"},{"g":"work"}]},{"text":"Том отнюдь не глуп.","en":"Tom is by no means stupid.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"not"},null]}]}